OL,3,GNEWSAMosque conversion appeal dismissed
OL,4,Aover parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert parts of an education
OL,7,Fcentre into a mosque have been refused
OL,8,Ffollowing an appeal.
OL,10,FBradford Council had refused planning
OL,11,Fpermission to turn the ground floor of
OL,12,Fthe Anwaar Ul Islam Education Centre on
OL,13,FWoodhall Avenue in Thornbury into a
OL,14,Fmosque back in March, citing parking
OL,15,Fand noise concerns.
OL,17,FApplicant Mohammed Kashif Ali appealed
OL,18,Fthe decision, prompting a
OL,19,Fgovernment-appointed planning inspector
OL,20,Fto review the application.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
