OL,3,GNEWSAMosque conversion appeal dismissed
OL,4,Aover parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FUpholding the council's decision and
OL,7,Fdismissing the appeal, inspector John
OL,8,FMorrison said the conversion would
OL,9,Fplace "additional pressure" on parking
OL,10,Fprovision in the area, which could give
OL,11,Frise to "indiscriminate parking to the
OL,12,Fdetriment of pedestrian safety".
